{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果或將調整新品發佈節奏，2027年年初集中推出iPhone 18e、新款入門iPad和MacBook Neo等平價產品。據彭博社記者馬克·古爾曼的消息，蘋果計劃在明年2月至3月間展開一輪以中低端設備為重點的發佈潮。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587672.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.889155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:27:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_hash":"ed9cdc00afffa4a564e74ab20dd34019f1d52c8c2800c340810dea135ba6a1d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}